# Ethical Considerations When Using AI

As AI tools become more widely used, it’s important to recognize that their use raises important ethical questions. While AI can support decision-making, creativity, and efficiency, it also introduces risks that users should consider when deciding how and when to use these tools.

Understanding these considerations helps ensure that AI is used thoughtfully, responsibly, and in ways that support, rather than undermine, human judgment.

## Key Ethical Considerations

👉 Click on the cards below to learn more about each key ethical consideration for using AI.

<div style="max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; color:#2f2f2f;">

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:14px;">

<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">Bias, Fairness, and Representation</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/5e53b543140be05ca532793a22ff1b31-Screenshot 2026-04-17 at 11.14.44 AM.png" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 12px 12px 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4;">
AI systems are trained on large datasets that may contain bias. As a result, they can reinforce or amplify inequities in language, representation, or perspective, making it important to critically evaluate outputs.
</div>
</details>

<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">Transparency, Accuracy, and Accountability</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/0bc36c51cecb73b7509ee59a264aa7f9-Screenshot 2026-04-17 at 11.14.47 AM.png" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 12px 12px 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4;">
AI systems do not always show how they generate responses, and their outputs may be incomplete or incorrect. Users remain responsible for evaluating accuracy and ensuring that AI-generated content is appropriate for use.
</div>
</details>

<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">Privacy and Data Protection</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/5acfb2c7a35e91013837b8d3f961aa58-Screenshot 2026-04-17 at 11.14.51 AM.png" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 12px 12px 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4;">
AI tools may collect or process user data. It is important to understand how data is used and to take steps to protect personal and sensitive information.</div>
</details>

<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">Safety, Security, and Appropriate Use</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/9e9edf8a919a7426b4bf2a94c7618294-Screenshot 2026-04-17 at 11.15.16 AM.png" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 12px 12px 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4;">
AI can be misused—for example, to generate misleading content or manipulate information. Ensuring safe and appropriate use is an important part of responsible AI integration.</div>
</details>

<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">Human Oversight and Professional Judgment</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/42ceac55d6187307f57cb14b8e2361af-Screenshot 2026-04-17 at 11.15.20 AM.png" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 12px 12px 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4;">
AI should support, not replace, human decision-making. Maintaining oversight and applying judgment is critical when using AI tools.</div>
</details>

<details style="background:#ffffff; border:2px solid #5a2ca0; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);">
<summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:0; display:block;">
<div style="padding:12px; text-align:center;">
<div style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:10px;">Broader Impacts</div>
<img src="https://images.code.org/3de4c06b9b13022b36c4acff70dacad4-Screenshot 2026-04-17 at 11.15.24 AM.png" style="width:150px; height:150px; object-fit:contain;">
</div>
</summary>
<div style="padding:0 12px 12px 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4;">
AI also raises broader considerations, including environmental impact, questions about ownership and copyright, and changes to the job market. While these may be less immediate in day-to-day use, they are important in understanding the full impact of AI.</div>
</details>

</div>
</div>

## Focus Areas in This Module
While all of these considerations are important, this module focuses on the areas most directly connected to **teaching and learning** in the classroom:
* **Misinformation and AI Fiction**: How AI can generate incorrect, misleading, or incomplete information, and how educators and students can identify and respond to it.
* **Algorithmic Bias**: How bias can appear in AI-generated content and what it means for representation, fairness, and student experience.
* **Data Privacy**: How to protect student information and make responsible choices when using AI tools in educational settings.
